.*
.* DSPPFM: a member's records through a window the program moves, as
.* characters or in hexadecimal side by side (F10) or under the
.* characters (F11).
:PNLGRP.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=CTLCL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=FINDCL BASETYPE='CHAR 30'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NBRCL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=LINECL BASETYPE='CHAR 78'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=FLAGCL BASETYPE='CHAR 1'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=FILE CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=LIB CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=MBR CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=RECORD CLASS=NBRCL.
:VAR NAME=COLUMN CLASS=NBRCL.
:VAR NAME=CTL CLASS=CTLCL.
:VAR NAME=FIND CLASS=FINDCL.
:VAR NAME=RULER CLASS=LINECL.
:VAR NAME=LINE CLASS=LINECL.
:VAR NAME=MODE CLASS=FLAGCL VALUE='C'.
:LISTDEF NAME=LINES VARS='LINE'.
:COND NAME=CHARS EXPR='&MODE. EQ "C"'.
:COND NAME=SIDE EXPR='&MODE. EQ "S"'.
:COND NAME=VERT EXPR='&MODE. EQ "V"'.
:COND NAME=HEX EXPR='&MODE. NE "C"'.
:COND NAME=NOTVERT EXPR='&MODE. NE "V"'.
:KEYL NAME=PFKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F19 ACTION='RETURN 19'.F19=Left
:KEYI KEY=F20 ACTION='RETURN 20'.F20=Right
:KEYI KEY=F24 ACTION=MOREKEYS.F24=More keys
:KEYI KEY=F10 ACTION='RETURN 10' COND=CHARS.F10=Display hexadecimal
:KEYI KEY=F10 ACTION='RETURN 10' COND=HEX.F10=Display character
:KEYI KEY=F11 ACTION='RETURN 11' COND=NOTVERT.F11=Display vertical
:KEYI KEY=F11 ACTION='RETURN 11' COND=VERT.F11=Display side-by-side
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=DSPPFM KEYL=PFKEYS HELP=DSPPFM ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=NONE BOTSEP=NONE.Display Physical File Member
:DATA DEPTH=4.
:DATACOL WIDTH=17.
:DATACOL WIDTH=41.
:DATAC.File . . . . . . :   &FILE.
:DATAC.Member . . . . . :   &MBR.
:DATAI VAR=CTL USAGE=INPUT CSRLOC.Control
:DATAI VAR=FIND USAGE=INPUT.Find
:DATACOL WIDTH=38.
:DATAC.Library  . . . . :   &LIB.
:DATAC.Record . . . . . :   &RECORD.
:DATAC.Column . . . . . :   &COLUMN.
:EDATA.
:DATA DEPTH=1.
:DATAC.&RULER.
:EDATA.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=LINES COMPACT.
:LISTCOL VAR=LINE USAGE=OUTPUT.
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=DSPPFM.Display Physical File Member - Help
:P.The records of a database file member in arrival order. Page up and
down move by a screen, F19 and F20 move the window left and right. On
the Control line, +n and -n move by records, a number goes to that
record, Wn starts the window at column n, and T and B go to the top and
the bottom. F10 shows the bytes in hexadecimal beside the characters,
F11 under them. F16 finds the text typed on the Find line.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
